# RX-02/FFI checked admission: committed result
PR: https://github.com/applicate2628/mcp-local-hub/pull/631
Code commit: b8457b9b12eb0866950b7df82640607463248651
Qualification/docs commit:
04ca025e49de430de7d8f1a7dcea0ffd2cab33d2
Previous head:
e0a05e3a6ec3b5ff14f3d70e935eabfda44ba445
Unchanged native parent625:
7ce04f7ef2f96680ed94db1edaf77cf0358421c4

Scope:7 files in ffi subtree, two commits pushed to existing631. Same NativeOwner; Go policy executes synchronously in original-process admission before resume, copied PID/image evidence, no raw handle/PID reopen.
Memory: native UTF16 copied into Go before policy/GC/retention; temporary integer cgo.Handle deleted after native return. No retained Go pointer/callback. Policy must return, not reenter/wait on same owner or use Goexit/longjmp.
Failure semantics: policy error/cancel/panic denies, consumes one-shot admission, retains owner. Nil policy has no effect. Duplicate observation does not rerun policy or erase original cause. Native unexpected panic/OOM still fail-stop, not isolation.
Fresh verification:15 top-level Go tests +2 nested panic cases,0 skips; debug/release DLL race x3; cgocheck2; Go vet; legacy panicnil mode;7 ABI unit tests debug/release; all53 parent checks debug/release; Clippy/fmt/diff checks.
Negative verification:5 optional functions in8 selected runs (2 metadata,4 malformed-observation variants,1 invalid decision,1 missing-export old DLL). Policy-denial-ignored mutation rejected by ordinary tests. All source mutations restored, standard DLL rebuilt, final normal race rerun.
TDD: initial rejecting stub compiled but failed behavior tests. Duplicate-callback cause loss reproduced RED then corrected by joining errors; correct DLL is not claimed to double-call.
Original path test uses owned Unicode copy + different dot-segment input spelling; observed native image name and absent pre-admission effect checked. Full path trust/token/user/creation-time product policy not implied.
No native Unix/cross-build/performance claim or independent review. Remaining full-policy fields, env/stdio/noninheritable marshalling, blocking IO, native-query/cleanup/allocator/panic/load faults, Unix/product adoption gates.
15 relevant skills applied this iteration; author self-review only. Working Hub/main/#616/parent625 code/config unchanged, no install/merge/release or model/provider/explicit bot/CI dispatch.
Remote/local readback exact and clean;7 source hashes match tested bytes. Unique evidence and active source/cache/normal DLLs remain outside trash. Verified obsolete old-DLL copy moved directly to approved trash after tests; source/hash/log reproducer kept; trash not emptied.
Progress reflected in plan623 comment6866434667 and current631 body.
